Create a 60-second premium cinematic future-tech soundtrack for a global AI digital transformation company called NEXORA DIGITAL.

Genre:
Cinematic Future Tech + Dark Ambient + Hybrid Electronic + Minimal Industrial.

Tempo:
108 BPM.

Key:
D minor with subtle futuristic tonal movement.

NO VOCALS.
NO SINGING.
NO RAP.
NO CHEESY CORPORATE MUSIC.

The music must sound extremely expensive, intelligent, futuristic and cinematic, like the soundtrack of a global technology company launching a revolutionary AI platform.

TIMELINE:

0-8 seconds:
Almost complete silence.
Deep sub-bass drone.
Very subtle atmospheric texture.
Tiny digital particles and distant electrical pulses.
Build mystery and anticipation.

8-20 seconds:
Introduce a precise electronic pulse.
Minimal synthetic percussion.
Deep controlled bass.
Subtle AI processing sounds.
The rhythm should feel like an advanced machine coming online.

20-30 seconds:
Introduce darker mechanical textures.
Slow industrial impacts.
Digital scanning sounds.
Tension increases as an old website is analyzed by AI.

30-40 seconds:
Major transformation moment.
Use a rising cinematic synth.
Layered electronic pulses.
Deep impact when the old website becomes a futuristic website.
Make this moment feel like a technological transformation.

40-50 seconds:
Introduce a powerful hybrid electronic rhythm.
Add subtle orchestral low strings.
Multiple rhythmic layers representing multiple AI agents joining a team.
Energy becomes more confident and sophisticated.

50-56 seconds:
Maximum technological intensity.
Deep bass.
Powerful cinematic impacts.
Fast digital pulses.
Large futuristic command-center feeling.
Build toward a major final reveal.

56-60 seconds:
Sudden reduction of rhythm.
One massive cinematic impact.
Long futuristic sub-bass tail.
Bright atmospheric shimmer.
End with a clean premium sonic signature suitable for the NEXORA DIGITAL logo.

Sound design:
deep sub bass,
analog synthesizers,
digital pulses,
AI processing textures,
soft mechanical movements,
cinematic impacts,
subtle metallic resonance,
futuristic atmosphere,
precision electronic percussion,
minimal orchestral elements.

Overall emotion:
INTELLIGENT.
POWERFUL.
MYSTERIOUS.
PREMIUM.
FUTURISTIC.
PRECISE.
GLOBAL.
REVOLUTIONARY.

The soundtrack must synchronize naturally with a futuristic 60-second visual presentation showing AI creating websites, modernizing legacy websites, assembling an AI team and operating a digital command center.

Final sound:
a memorable premium technology logo sound.
